      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_2; report SHA256 cb8d6b0d43665af39b8757f456bc312c08152c5ac895d2e21e6047a015afeac4; original target report-time-viewpoint.options[all-current].why. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "This incorrectly presents the finished illness and earlier client\n      conversation as current.",
      "explanation": "The option is correctly rejected because Liv is now healthy, but its explanation also says the present perfect han allerede har snakket incorrectly makes the earlier client conversation current. A present-perfect report can still refer to a completed earlier conversation with present relevance. That clause alone does not contradict the supplied timeline.",
